# 1. DOCUMENT PURPOSE

This document defines how the approved ZyrionOS product experience,
information architecture, and design system must be converted into
production-grade frontend code.

This document establishes the engineering rules for:

- React architecture
- Page architecture
- Component architecture
- Feature architecture
- Routing
- State management
- API integration
- Authentication
- Forms
- Loading states
- Error states
- Empty states
- Success states
- Modals
- Drawers
- Notifications
- AI interfaces
- Workspace interfaces
- Deployment interfaces
- Responsive behavior
- Accessibility
