# 4. PAGE ARCHITECTURE

Every primary navigation destination is a full application page.

Examples:

- Dashboard
- Workspace
- Projects
- AI Chat
- Agents
- Automation
- Analytics
- Billing
- Settings
- Profile
- Security
- Notifications

A primary product destination must not unnecessarily be implemented
as a small card or restricted panel inside another page.

