Settings
↓
FULL SETTINGS PAGE

Billing
↓
FULL BILLING PAGE

Projects
↓
FULL PROJECTS PAGE

Workspace
↓
FULL WORKSPACE PAGE

The UI must never make a primary destination feel like a
small embedded widget when the product specification defines
it as a full application environment.

